ping execution introduces )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (data hazards)Tj/F1 10.5 Tf ( \(an)Tj .625016 Tw T* (instruction needing a result that has not yet been written back\) and )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (control hazards)Tj/F1 10.5 Tf ( \(the next fetch)Tj .075735 Tw T* (address depending on a branch that has not yet resolved\). The design therefore adds three pieces of)Tj -.03521 Tw T* (dedicated hazard hardware: a )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (forwarding \(bypass\) unit)Tj/F1 10.5 Tf ( that routes freshly computed results back to)Tj .366213 Tw T* (the EX stage, a combinational )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (stall-detection unit)Tj/F1 10.5 Tf ( that inserts bubbles for the unavoidable load-use)Tj 1.383305 Tw T* (and multiply-use cases, and a )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (flush unit)Tj/F1 10.5 Tf ( that squashes wrong-path instructions once a branch or)Tj 0 Tw T* (jump is resolved.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.69291 360.5276 cm 0 0 0 rg BT .688105 Tw/F1 10.5 Tf 0 98 TD (In accordance with the lab specification, conditional branches and unconditional jumps are resolved)Tj 2.261555 Tw 0 -15.5 TD (in pipeline )Tj/F2 10.5 Tf (stage)Tj ( )Tj (4 \(MEM\))Tj/F1 10.5 Tf (, and the multiplier is split across two pipeline stages \(partial-product)Tj .18861 Tw T* (generation in EX, accumulation in MEM\) so that it does not dominate the critical path. The remainder)Tj 7.437251 Tw T* (of this report presents the top-level structure, the RTL-Viewer netlists, a quantitative)Tj 2.670974 Tw T* <506f77657296506572666f726d616e6365964172656120285050412920636f6d70617269736f6e206265747765656e207468652073696e676c652d6379636c6520616e6420706970656c696e65642064657369676e732c2061>Tj 1.057984 Tw T* (description of every HDL source file, and an analysis of the simulation waveforms used to validate)Tj 0 Tw T* (system timing against the benchmark applications.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.69291 325.5276 cm .062745 .141176 .243137 rg BT/F2 15 Tf 0 4 TD (2.)Tj ( )Tj ( )Tj (Top-Level Block Review Diagram)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.69291 209.0276 cm 0 0 0 rg BT .670479 Tw/F1 10.5 Tf 0 98 T